{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1457,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b561355cf4796c1e196f456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和旺紫丁大人一起寻找秋天的花。\r\n即使我这么慢吞吞，她也一直\r\n陪在身边……真是感谢她♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44fbfb688dcc887423059ede33e682fa0d2dbf9f09874aa07b09c0535114167f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9afc118d3d2c36b4fcf8be53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毛茸茸的手套与外套……到了冬天，\r\n大家的模样都会变得很可爱呢。\r\n因为看起来，就像小绵羊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "14df116db137ab75d971c4756f2753befe024bb81d2fee2b1fce56a30ad511b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3b08f6d942c666e74c432bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快～乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0a9171d8bfba7949b0895fe41547ac3189ce3e0162ebef9dea09d68a56c996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45fcf35f20239c4b54caae6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的大家\r\n真的都非常温柔～\r\n总是愿意等我～",
      "source_fingerprint": "444f39de085cd8033141ba4443ad172bb6ffc89415c75a6240bdf321dfc4105c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae19909f52421577ada159c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦～啦啦啦～啦～♪\r\n跟赖恩姐姐一起散步♪\r\n互相挽着手，也别忘了牵手～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc82fe00b6637f55eb6b734e7dc081bf9074e5952d14e0d92a5fc74971500002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41afd53b159f03cf5273b74e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有一个自豪的回忆。\r\n小时候，我的名字常常\r\n在主题乐园里被广播念出来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c69a94c94a801b961ec824bf7b804b9d38dfbd7e3d789510ff7fe55c8f7281e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9661f1bba2f04fa2450e8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………哇啊！？\r\n呜呜～还是会有刺痛感～\r\n原来辣味会残留好几天啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb60c494db92a6d39a355a32e158483ab58ac58a2ee57ffc861d0ce2c0579bda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1993e8dcf5b07af7986edbf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "娃娃帽、蓬蓬的衬裙、蕾丝袖套……\r\n总有一天我要跟目白家的各位\r\n一起办场满是荷叶边的茶会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d870009bddeb74a5339d2a63a78252a4750dd53fb7ee9204500d4ae5f84e5d0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de08ba431a2ace3d5e48c5a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是和大家都同款的衣服喔～\r\n来拍一堆照片吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28c0bb1b4054b8f2fbe11d48c691142dd81c7b65769128c9741f4831462c21e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6555b3a1129c7f9abbccebd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然跳舞很不简单……\r\n但穿上这套服装，让我觉得自己\r\n能跳出利落的舞蹈呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cba8d99d1cd09f1061313f22557084ba5f0fa99df1fdb00207a81f2787747ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d0a291975e8105597ac393d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用自己的光芒……\r\n衬托出绿宝石的美丽光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad54b304c0bdbd7016306962e4e13004cb6a666a78893c54cb71007d55f476f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12eee24e0ee7ed8676f2724d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的耳饰跟多伯的一样喔。\r\n我说想跟她戴同款的，她就特别\r\n设计了这款……真是温柔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aef8376bd69f7081b54dabdbefad93bfae40d7b711dffd706407c2518468929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e983373caedc3a8c8ef587c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，请帮忙\r\n找开关……帮我找出可以\r\n瞬间消除困意的开关～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae87a5289bc590d8a565bd64d7350c7f6322a57176e945d6c68ade3be160e255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9dcd76c70874ac6c9d6f9ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不可思议～每次我吃完午餐\r\n要回去时，餐厅里都人去楼空了～\r\n大家吃饭速度都好快喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc4febe5fba341d86d365953d1b3d20a7d3580721bfe2b5c592c1f7c88f9c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ad53a106203e724f8d9487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小槙、小方……\r\n今天该陪哪位洋娃娃\r\n一起睡觉呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fa506bef8a8d272e81082a50dc3ff58a7e7a8fa3dd73c76ccf780468ea86b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caea1489c94885e150b1ac94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………呼哇。\r\n春天很容易想打瞌睡～\r\n……你愿意拍拍我的头吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda70d05d730f0e4248e8d6d700ca1e0da6e59851e3ae2902c0963dcd1592f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4181cd8cc0697cc8f150d47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我很憧憬赖恩姐姐的\r\n健康肤色……跑去晒太阳\r\n结果却发烧了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76eab4c9d60f0865b91c00e680bdc02a0b40664b2efa1ee330286d83fe8c687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7cdfc03f9c9ad40f4eac920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问你喜欢地瓜吗～？\r\n黄金船送了我好多，\r\n来办场派对吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f834b7837e1b0f5ee11a735b552d689f9ffff3569ee8b4481a4b687d4fd46cad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac51fd83430a266a89ec15f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在松软的雪地打雪仗，我想到一个\r\n好主意了～！我要自己化身为雪球，\r\n直直地撞向对手♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6407d71c4209ed33f591af6f7c3b707be3c91e5979cd5ab74c4e4f79fee223",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b795be1a496f37f23ef4daf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶，爱你哟～！…呵呵，\r\n这是善信大人的朋友教我的\r\n问候语，下次也要对目白家的各位说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1023a6ef5df400e582075a11682c8fa34ced683f78ff55396ebf2ca1f0c9cc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71dc44a474b7aa73ee670384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和高峰大人一起散步时，一转眼\r\n就会跟丢她。不过不用着急\r\n慢慢来，找她就好～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e06ba3de69271ce00f842647b8c76630ddb0c726b3403df5216bbdd39eac45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2974fd56cf7c0f9f157a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼♪哼哼哼♪\r\n嗯？和大家一起唱的时候，\r\n不知为何总会变成轮唱呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b6899987f9623a60e198f4fcf8d0c7eb71140fb33bc3993b6a094c22fa7931f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1f855813c12463e7957844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞蛋糕上的草莓，我会留到最后\r\n再吃。因为鲜奶油会先\r\n融化掉嘛～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e557e1eccce85b7a6f18b5bfa845fb1d81d32d9d572acbcd4790299ecd110a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d67104993fe5eec6889450d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我父亲的游乐园举办圣诞活动时\r\n我也帮了忙。\r\n那些角色的服装一定要看喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea91c0414fc5b72525009227025a9bd575462befc80261af82003569c634286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7c8de74cb9c5433d9b84b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上要是迅速做好准备，\r\n就能早点拆开枕边的礼物\r\n呢。没错，大概中午左右就能～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5859188cecdfcc6cd1c0f5dde1643cbe5a804ae2771754b6f4a4a698e40396c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b22363f626fa6040717fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坐在长椅上休息时\r\n有人说我像洋娃娃一样，听到这话……\r\n若能被看作小槙的朋友我会很开心",
      "source_fingerprint": "8acf5c6a8768cacf6ff80093ee0faa734958b2a003a7cf0df3d270ed6d1d6ff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc777652c208b2d6df04be0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家睡着后，洋娃娃们会\r\n偷偷举办茶会\r\n……如果真是这样，不觉得很美好吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff54c3f3a937d0aa1ef86dbbde69da574e9824fd157ecf97c7744cb7c169b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397336ca5744eaf51addfba3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来～啦，樱花花瓣店开张了～。\r\n积在软帽上的樱花花瓣，\r\n想要多少都分给您～",
      "source_fingerprint": "40cbed3a59c8a37010794eaec123b4f510407d0acb179602650f6e086d05e8d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9158359a4f10f8e3ccaaedd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要撑起心爱的遮阳伞，夏日的\r\n阳光也不足为惧。接下来\r\n为了不融化，只需忍耐就好～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db5f8c8463ade972f455f8bb74b7913a8ad901aaaa0e6cdaf0cf35138205fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7ffca3e3b1ae28dd20b52f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "松果、坚果……都收集起来\r\n做成花环吧。再用蕾丝\r\n丝绸、毛绒装饰一番",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f1293dff836bd76293d2a19cd36b03dab875826f1523ec1c2abaffb3f2f733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682852739f56af26e1936e72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打雪仗我们从没输过喔～。\r\n赖恩姐姐负责投球，多伯\r\n和我负责做雪球就是最强组合",
      "source_fingerprint": "279dd5942aa87312e05c1cf60c89685129ce3d0a36d8f79566eedfbf6a78b9cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a576bf6694a6ab737d7ee652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到圣诞节的人偶就是\r\n胡桃夹子先生了。我用嘴\r\n很难夹开核桃，不过用手就能～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e720bdaf7798fa32733b5db0073f1a69771a11e5814c975737aa70d5139fe0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebaf66abf53e1c2f948b9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵，来猜谜吧～。某处\r\n藏着一颗爱心。…至于正确答案，\r\n请在比赛中，自行确认～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "625cdb4b4a0d395428e379e31fca358eb7224ba5f68206b691d3840bf27bd0e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b098e1c9e77bc2d69509806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我经常和天空大人一边钓鱼\r\n一边出～神地眺望地平线…。\r\n如此安静，令人放松的时光……呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f85a5017d2f1ab09351ffecd11d205504087add248d8685ec14800d25f5c620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a8c98915037acc7fe121c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正和小槙聊天时……杏目大人\r\n拿着嘚嘚玩偶和我搭话\r\n了！她真是位俏皮的人呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2694630dfdd6b6007b16a35c7211c1261076cf8c49eb0c81087b953b7870bc3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38fbdf406552930e775d548",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当潘多拉大人向我撒娇，\r\n我就忍不住鼓足干劲～。\r\n毕竟，她会让我想起妹妹们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b01ef45a5df1d48c9e6b714f88cee1f5c8895fc363d5d21eed237742d15e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bdb7f4a6d522ddbae3b8bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神业大人，没想到您竟然喜欢人偶\r\n呢～。…至于我，也想和那位\r\n素描人偶先生做朋友……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "22575583f1902c78dde671c16a2eaa8c2268b297585396f869fb34540995dfab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877ae5e282cdb6088b60f842",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能和黄金旅程大人多聊聊天，\r\n下次我们会一起去旅行。\r\n前往四季如春的国家……真期待呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "19da038ce059a997d714dca2718d463a148dd1faccf1fd595e5fd625c1f7f5cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc08ce1b2b98986092e6323b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早餐时，我和红色梦想大人聊了\r\n甜美洛丽塔的新款服装♪\r\n呵呵，希望有一天能和她一起穿",
      "source_fingerprint": "70783bce470a31f6df30cadfb1b92a9a76db153ba8535b0ebe20124e6f409826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7b964dd571e39ea1ea6d2c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多，该补涂防晒霜\r\n了。…希望能赶在午休结束前\r\n涂完就好～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aee23f125725a46b20584835540eea918a763f407af144fa4b5bd5537f555a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5a274e841c041c14e7ef75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水床……能睡在水上\r\n真是太美妙了～。不知道\r\n在梦里，能不能变成人鱼……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a29ac54434b9b02b05cc96cbdacb8c289b1eef73061dbb4071c8d93116206d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84050b4e6141babef349151c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去赏花时，小槙她们也会一起\r\n去呢。飞舞的樱花配上春色衣裳\r\n……得多拍些照片留念才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "66d6a38e47872358880297814b6bbaf93e851acc3980f47e92fe4a9c6d9fb48e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5def856e07ca1efd7537c3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家去避暑地的湖边时，\r\n我经常和善信大人打高尔夫\r\n呢。在大自然中自～由自在，真舒服♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4cbc9b3029ef40338951e292c506597dea55b4d06563fba7bd7288e66b1796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c75ba05641d031399d752b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏月总让我心里怦怦直跳。\r\n也许是小时候总担心兔子先生\r\n会不会从月亮上掉下来～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b12cd47d493cb939da06c214b4a2fd5767e3335d6187fc941c770d10145521c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78fccd171a3d986018ac88d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢慢织着围巾时，\r\n不知不觉织得像蛇先生一样长\r\n了……要不要一起围上试试？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d4bdded8a9ff20d4dac9f943372584eb796fb6e03cc3abf9c9b2fe02df6503d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c3a2a0d95d22f0d3f32a50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这枚琥珀发饰，您不觉得它闪耀着\r\n绝美的光辉吗～？如此高雅，又柔和……\r\n有一天，我也想绽放这样的光辉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e860844a8d624995fbba5b179adcc30ce9c4fb4717379649ff443cf5aa13356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f6bd82d81885c382494226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候，目白家的姐姐大人们身穿\r\n典雅泳装的模样是那么耀眼……\r\n儿时的梦想，终于实现了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "45939770441c23c0689c3faf534e6f7116f276880a3bc4d4c73d295d10526499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323a87a136f0721c1a41ad3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享用完茶跟点心，\r\n这下准备万全了～\r\n我随时可以上场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "580cfe7e7626febe68e6dfce80825c7349758fcdb650a2da8700d26087a16029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:351fc892dd10107a2fa249b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2548fb5f79fc734c38892900db400818e25ed3bb406f4854ca05fc1e5e70330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76575c99ec9224fe13ba360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，训练员要不要\r\n也一起奔跑呢？\r\n草地跑起来很舒服喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8ece48521a87ec0754e7d5b50823fa285b4f343d8e19bacde41a6b34ed4f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16fb88d6366f43c6ae55ce6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我动作慢，\r\n但我会诚心地……\r\n专注进行每一项练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7202ea0bc6543c29af73c4c2e6926a834ea3068fe4093cb4be14c0da877c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d5de0b3c0c85728214759bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看着我的眼睛。\r\n……能看到那颗燃烧的心吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d6bcde963d75a27037e540603ee6a5a9044c066aa3672374d84bb5d58f9444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0125ce9da42b9214ddc055f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到疲倦时就好好休息吧～\r\n我会一直在这里等着你的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6284e1b14e126d227379a28b65585fc4313a3d4c501ec7e9b15a24272a21b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745bba184c8162ca0d43260a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们之间步调也很契合，已经可说是\r\n最佳默契拍檔了吧～\r\n默～契……默～契～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "582c2b1c3bfb38ae23c0542fc955a623ba1880e19753d053f1e2b9090d955f4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93026a67a58ede455cdfdc70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曾有人告诉我，感到冬天漫长时，\r\n就代表春天也快到了～\r\n我……真的很幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38cc2f1ac8cf90ec3fb98117d03d5a5d58befc063b29e7be01f19736df97f3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cea80f742c021e97a468c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，仔细倾听……\r\n听得见海浪声呢～\r\n呵呵呵，听起来好像摇篮曲～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9756f7ceb3f14d9291b4eeca670c2641f35575869fd173edac3bcf9890ee239",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8107368ea626c8751e88983e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了把胜利当作礼物送出去。\r\n我会一步一个脚印，稳步成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85078b30c66d51e49397cc8b66e63aa36edb6bfcdafbc08acbf274da6ec17662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653de8efc2783bb6b914d03b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要能一直一直，跑得更久\r\n就能实现跑遍全世界的愿望\r\n呢。作为圣诞老人，我会努力的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c12d3697f05a2037b945f4324711298421624c175fa112b81ca26a45748c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6659d245597a1863a1bbdff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会为大家送上\r\n令人目眩神迷的光辉。\r\n毕竟，我可是目白家的圣诞老人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3c00681b16e95139b89a9cdd4e186002696ac3889b30de25f9b56f6d4a752d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2d5e02fb69ba2cb6624bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的圣诞派对上大家会\r\n通过大屏幕为『有马纪念』助威\r\n呢。场面非常震撼喔～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb4d43bfda49a4b0a7b0567e644bb045e759180ae96b9a83d3be7e6f292efd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04735c5de7fcf53514bf4558",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员大人，您对这样的\r\n服装也有兴趣吗？\r\n如果穿同款一起奔跑应该很可爱～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "178b6033f1edc3694117307ab821f0e953ab84bfda4da36ea77308d60f598864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84a5bd3e87a6c89fb786fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候，我喜欢让人抱起来装饰\r\n圣诞树顶端的星星。\r\n在比赛中，也要点亮白色星星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "401e417377284fbc47f9b6ad5b0b143df68fd290dd584219f533ecfe0fc61584",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea04b7e47eb95e7e413ecb5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于训练员大人，我想献上一场特别的\r\n胜利。\r\n即使准备要花很久，也一定会做到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb7f062705a8d955ca595c898c49f600d0030a760832e00f358d5e78de1259f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c3fb73481206db8855c37b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像这套泳装一样，优雅地\r\n前进吧～。我好歹也是\r\n目白家的赛马娘，当然要优雅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a432673e6992eb0d65ec93d3c909f710ea0a8cd33e930ece3d01e9eee888d43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d021b6d9f0e03d78638ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一～～，二～～…呵呵，\r\n热身运动已经做得很充分～。\r\n那么，出发吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "260e28fe169848c121eb8f30bf1b6d8507ebc3533e3eb60ef0da5d133a0f28c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089162c92d0f21ca25c225f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像堆沙堡一样…。\r\n训练也要慢慢来，\r\n谨慎地一点点积累～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d02b85e547390082d3e7242fc9867ad531f433cc734a76e3a3f16e1c650bc42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663b84381fc1b4fe3695d36d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次看到训练用轮胎，\r\n就想去海上悠悠漂浮呢～。\r\n因为它看起来，就像游泳圈一样",
      "source_fingerprint": "930336ece7dec02db97f5f6efca9d7513fc80d8cc480403cd0642615167724a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fbe25b55128648e7afbf821",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果阳光太强，请告诉我\r\n一声。我带了足够两人用的阳伞\r\n呢，一起休息一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "731ccbdbce7131f0b303dc0266a32bc05f6d2faa3143f91c144f5a5de94d0af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de43c1b8cd8d942e8044292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多大的风浪都请交给我～。\r\n只要是训练员大人的指示，\r\n我一定会跨越过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2332962de1f9e37b50959ef9d8228bd4dcc64a85584acb5cf3cbb439bb76acac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba00d358dfca1436d027354d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您愿意一直陪在我身边，眺望\r\n沉入海中的美丽夕阳…。正因为是这样的您\r\n我才想，与您携手同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e9ba83a7ba2386fef1a31c3caf8666be75d19db99812e1ac7a46ab21f5f67b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb488e495e2ae7a876e407d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请摸摸头称赞我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cba014a404f88563994eb8601f8e27282a27cca964a1602b15d5ad8aba6decd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ac7bbe2b4426491dc742df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时受你诸多照顾了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb954c0070d973d8eb633b47507404d7f6cb2d974b395298348ac55a3df6341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb66875599e6cf3b639b11bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于，我点亮了奇迹的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f881e6090390b0d5ac85de5a4660b76cc3c8e118b3644e0193f5b4c35326ef14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5f7ac8dafc731555de52cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于，我把礼物送出去了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a1dea2e39d857ba1d0b2b67eab926f5ae6c6d3cf0e8ccec041927ef2f9e501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bea207714749e88416890f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使要去往大海彼岸，只要和您一起…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70ad91c27415d9dd87ad6e96b7391c2d251e0968556b7b438de43bfde4dfef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f9aa52b0a12dfa9db6a37e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，慢～慢地抵达终点了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6ef338afbd74b284e7e65df8824a8d84900417afb24ff27d4a0d552157c486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f605683c0dc87a187d9681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自～在～写～意～地一路成长～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d261218985462ff4c68aabd35daa442d385da9879c8451001f174e2d428b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9371057accc2f46538a87db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是专属于我的武器呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "50aff5ed062f9b595c340ca88af207a80ece5624b5f1de831120da1c495572e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b22fa779d20674373241b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好呀～我是目白光明～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f62aad8d6c6b818e746d87a208eb1d0286db02889a05d6e5ab962f4e5dcf349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e255b0473b5cbfc0b30d215f",
